{"author":"lars@oddbit.com","body":"This has been resolved by reconfiguring the routers in station mode and letting\ndd-wrt manage the 2.4ghz configuration. The devices still assert 192.168.1.1 on\nthe LAN ports at boot, but this isn't visible to the house network, and now\nwe're no longer seeing that address asserted over wireless. Time from reboot to\nlogin is about 2 minutes."}